He wrote both science fiction and popular science

00:01:14.780 --> 00:01:16.400
God, I hope he didn't get those two mixed up.

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:20.080
Ah! Yes, well, funny you should mention that, Gary.

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:23.240
"I have the manuscripts here of my
important scientific work...

00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:26.180
"and my one here about men with 
bum-faces from Venus.

